  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n[The spec says](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#id150) \"Users may encounter content which they find inappropriate and should be able to report it to the server administrators **or room moderators for review**.\" but Synapse doesn't currently expose reported messages to room moderators as far as I know. I would be great if you could report a message and have the room moderators act on it without having to ping individual moderators.\r\n\r\nRelated to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/4007 - event reports get lost in a database table\r\n",
